-- Plate's case fold, toUpperCase then toLowerCase, with no collation named: upper() and lower() under the
-- database's own provider are Unicode's simple mappings, so the full uppercase of SpecialCasing's 102
-- unconditional code points is applied first, U+0130's full lowercase before lower(), and Final_Sigma on the
-- uppercased text. A source, edited here: its tables are Unicode 17.0's, the full uppercases SpecialCasing-17.0.0's
